--   2.  body_type (representative vehicle)          (from vehicle_2016)
--   3.  number_of_drunk_drivers                     (accident_2016)
--   4.  day_of_week                                 (accident_2016)
--   5.  hour_of_crash                               (accident_2016)
--   6.  is_work_zone  : 1 if work_zone ≠ 'None'     (accident_2016)
--   7.  speed_diff_level : bucketed mean |speed-limit|
--         – compute mean |travel_speed – speed_limit| per crash
--         – keep only vehicle rows with   travel_speed 0-151   (drop 997/998/999)
--                                           speed_limit  5-80   (drop 98/99)
--         – bucket into 0 [0,20), 1 [20,40), 2 [40,60), 3 [60,80), 4 [80,+)
-- Approach:
--   • Build three helper subqueries, then join:
--       sp   : average speed difference
--       lbl  : keep crashes with >1 persons and set label
--       veh  : representative body_type (ANY_VALUE)
--   • Join helpers to accident_2016 (a); derive features; LIMIT 20 for sample.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
